WEBVTT

01:30.410 --> 01:34.960
[The Heir]

01:35.420 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 11]

01:38.280 --> 01:39.070
Old Madam,

01:39.229 --> 01:41.840
Master Qi of Yihousheng
has come for a visit.

01:43.710 --> 01:44.680
Show him in.

01:44.759 --> 01:45.680
Sift the tea.

01:45.380 --> 01:47.800
["Sift the tea" means "serve tea"
in ancient Huizhou dialect]

01:45.710 --> 01:46.310
Yes.

01:48.310 --> 01:51.509
I'm sure any tea served here
must be excellent, Old Madam.

01:52.479 --> 01:55.310
However, as a rough and coarse man

01:55.310 --> 01:56.150
myself,

01:56.310 --> 01:59.070
I'm unable to discern the charm
within this tea.

02:00.070 --> 02:01.310
No worries.

02:01.590 --> 02:04.120
Even the best tea is meant to be drunk.

02:05.680 --> 02:08.150
Master Qi, where did you come from?

02:08.150 --> 02:11.520
The Chen residence, the Pan residence,
or the Tian residence?

02:11.520 --> 02:13.000
In my opinion,

02:13.520 --> 02:14.840
you have probably

02:15.000 --> 02:16.710
visited all the ink makers

02:17.000 --> 02:18.590
in Huizhou, haven't you?

02:19.400 --> 02:20.310
Old Madam,

02:20.590 --> 02:22.660
I am from out of town.

02:22.750 --> 02:25.750
In order to do business in Huizhou,

02:25.840 --> 02:28.570
I have to visit all the fellow ink makers,
don't I?

02:28.800 --> 02:30.560
On the banquet that day,

02:30.560 --> 02:32.280
I met you for the first time,

02:32.280 --> 02:33.560
yet we didn't get to talk.

02:33.560 --> 02:35.000
It was truly a pity.

02:35.280 --> 02:38.680
So, I came today especially
to pay you a visit, Old Madam.

02:47.400 --> 02:48.190
Old Madam,

02:50.430 --> 02:52.710
I fortunately obtained a painting.

02:54.120 --> 02:57.000
The creator of this work
cannot be identified.

02:57.910 --> 03:00.840
But the content of it
is rather interesting.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.900
Please take a look, Old Madam.

03:13.030 --> 03:14.190
This is...

03:14.630 --> 03:16.470
The pawner of this painting told me

03:16.470 --> 03:18.360
that this scroll shows

03:18.360 --> 03:21.470
how the masters of Li Ink
made ink along the river

03:21.470 --> 03:24.520
after the founder of the South Tang
restored his ancestral surname.

03:24.520 --> 03:25.750
What a spectacle.

03:26.430 --> 03:27.470
Indeed.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.150
Old Madam,

03:34.030 --> 03:36.090
I took the liberty to call on you today

03:36.360 --> 03:37.680
because I think

03:37.840 --> 03:40.470
that Li Ink is the perfect home

03:40.630 --> 03:41.960
for this painting.

03:44.240 --> 03:45.040
How very nice.

03:45.560 --> 03:46.430
Here,

03:48.190 --> 03:50.079
I extend my gratitude to you with tea

03:50.079 --> 03:51.810
instead of alcohol, Master Qi.

03:57.150 --> 03:58.360
Master Qi,

03:58.520 --> 04:01.190
since you're looking to
enter the ink industry,

04:01.630 --> 04:05.520
why did you open a pawnshop
instead of an ink workshop?

04:06.520 --> 04:09.750
Old Madam, I know my limits.

04:10.280 --> 04:13.030
I only have
a superficial knowledge of ink.

04:13.520 --> 04:16.720
Rushing into the ink industry could
easily be to my detriment.

04:16.720 --> 04:17.630
It's better to...

04:17.630 --> 04:20.040
It's better to test the ink makers
in Huizhou

04:20.040 --> 04:24.120
and select the best by posing a challenge
about the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

04:24.120 --> 04:25.560
Old Madam, that's an overstatement.

04:25.560 --> 04:28.690
How would I dare to test
the prestigious ink makers here?

04:29.070 --> 04:31.390
Given that Lord Yan has just taken office,

04:31.390 --> 04:34.070
and that I'd like to do
some small business here,

04:34.159 --> 04:37.220
I'm just riding the momentum
and seeking a lucky start.

04:37.800 --> 04:41.530
As the saying goes, politics cannot
stay afloat without commerce.

04:42.040 --> 04:44.600
In turn, proper governance builds
a stable commercial environment.

04:44.600 --> 04:45.870
Master Qi,

04:46.040 --> 04:49.040
you're running
quite a significant business here.

04:50.070 --> 04:50.950
Old Madam,

04:51.830 --> 04:54.600
whether my business is significant or not

04:54.950 --> 04:56.240
depends on you.

05:07.950 --> 05:09.040
Miss Li Zhen,

05:09.510 --> 05:10.430
are you busy?

05:17.560 --> 05:18.430
Miss Li Zhen,

05:19.040 --> 05:21.560
Old Madam asked me to bring you
some black tea.

05:21.560 --> 05:22.960
Why don't you take a break

05:23.000 --> 05:24.200
and enjoy a cup of tea?

05:54.750 --> 05:57.750
No impurities. A fragrant smell.

05:58.750 --> 06:00.430
Solid black and lustrous.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.190
How nice.

06:02.430 --> 06:04.270
This is really nice.

06:05.040 --> 06:06.750
But its texture

06:07.090 --> 06:08.930
is worlds apart from that

06:08.960 --> 06:10.690
of the super-grade lampblack.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.390
What a huge shame.

06:13.870 --> 06:15.560
This is truly a shame.

06:16.390 --> 06:17.480
Such a shame!

06:24.040 --> 06:25.830
What do you want, Master Qi?

06:30.480 --> 06:32.680
The Old Madam asked me
to bring you some black tea.

06:32.680 --> 06:34.080
Would you like a cup of it?

06:34.240 --> 06:36.800
Master Qi, you met with
the Seventh Old Madam

06:36.870 --> 06:37.950
and then me.

06:38.600 --> 06:39.390
Speak up.

06:39.830 --> 06:41.159
What is it that you want?

06:41.560 --> 06:43.950
Can't I just come check on the making

06:43.970 --> 06:46.760
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink?

06:47.120 --> 06:47.830
Don't close it.

06:47.830 --> 06:49.890
You've opened it. Why rush to shut it?

06:50.720 --> 06:51.430
I...

06:51.800 --> 06:53.390
I do have a favor to ask.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.310
Say it.

06:55.680 --> 06:58.680
Miss Li Zhen, could you help me persuade
the Old Madam

06:58.870 --> 06:59.950
to team up with me

07:00.070 --> 07:01.170
on ink business?

07:05.310 --> 07:07.160
If I remember correctly,

07:08.190 --> 07:09.390
Master Qi,

07:09.720 --> 07:12.680
you visited the Tian family
just the day before,

07:12.920 --> 07:14.430
and then the Chen family.

07:14.430 --> 07:16.920
Now, today, you insist on
cooperating with Li Ink.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.830
What exactly is your purpose?

07:19.480 --> 07:20.430
I am a businessman.

07:20.430 --> 07:21.870
What purpose could I have?

07:21.870 --> 07:23.270
Of course I am seeking

07:23.270 --> 07:25.920
a business ally
who I can share weal and woes with.

07:25.920 --> 07:27.050
The Li family aside,

07:27.270 --> 07:29.070
Miss Li Zhen, if you are willing,

07:29.480 --> 07:31.140
I can also cooperate with you.

07:32.070 --> 07:34.159
Since you don't trust me, Master Qi,

07:34.270 --> 07:36.270
and you're reluctant to tell the truth,

07:36.270 --> 07:37.560
then there is nothing

07:37.630 --> 07:39.159
we can talk about.

07:39.630 --> 07:40.430
Please leave.

07:41.070 --> 07:43.070
Miss Li Zhen, that's not right.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.630
I am telling the truth.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.070
Besides, think about it.

07:47.070 --> 07:48.560
You've promised Lord Yan

07:48.560 --> 07:50.750
to make the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

07:50.750 --> 07:52.810
You can't back out from this game now.

07:53.190 --> 07:54.680
So why not partner with me?

07:55.680 --> 07:56.810
With my assistance,

07:57.480 --> 08:00.610
you'll surely get twice the result
with half the effort.

08:01.680 --> 08:03.080
I'm already in this game.

08:03.360 --> 08:05.480
Master Qi, do you really not know
who got me

08:05.480 --> 08:06.680
into this situation?

08:07.390 --> 08:08.270
Please, Miss Li Zhen,

08:08.270 --> 08:10.720
try not to assume the worst of others.

08:11.040 --> 08:12.720
Perhaps the one who arranged this game

08:12.720 --> 08:13.830
is playing

08:14.070 --> 08:15.870
the black pieces like you are.

08:26.950 --> 08:28.830
Wood's burning. Keep the draft away.

08:28.830 --> 08:29.630
Got it.

08:32.669 --> 08:33.870
I'll put the tea here.

08:55.750 --> 08:57.150
Miss Li Zhen, it turns out

08:57.960 --> 09:00.490
that you learned
such fine ink-making skills

09:00.600 --> 09:02.000
from this ancient manual

09:02.550 --> 09:04.200
on ink production.

09:07.440 --> 09:09.170
This must be the Ink Chronicles

09:09.910 --> 09:11.080
written by He Yuan.

09:13.360 --> 09:14.560
You came back so soon.

09:15.080 --> 09:16.960
Selling this book to me at 100 taels

09:16.960 --> 09:18.360
wouldn't put you at a loss, you know?

09:18.360 --> 09:20.620
Careful. This is the only existing copy.

09:20.870 --> 09:22.930
This is the book, the Ink Chronicles.

09:25.510 --> 09:27.150
Have someone ride a fast horse and deliver

09:27.150 --> 09:28.240
this book to my brother.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.720
The critical phase for ink making
has arrived now.

09:29.720 --> 09:31.120
No mistakes are allowed.

09:33.390 --> 09:34.390
Master Qi,

09:34.390 --> 09:37.390
you're actually more knowledgeable
than I expected,

09:37.910 --> 09:41.040
for having done studies
on ancient ink-making manuals.

09:44.200 --> 09:47.930
Would you let go of this treasure,
Miss Li Zhen, painful as it may be?

09:48.910 --> 09:52.030
I'll be glad to pay a handsome price
for the Ink Chronicles.

09:52.030 --> 09:53.910
How very strange, Master Qi.

09:54.240 --> 09:57.480
Why would you spend a fortune
on an old book?

10:09.750 --> 10:11.910
It's the only copy
of this ancient classic

10:11.910 --> 10:13.720
and of great collectible value.

10:14.440 --> 10:17.200
It cannot be measured by gold or silver.

10:19.600 --> 10:22.460
Then I'm afraid you'll be disappointed,
Master Qi.

10:23.080 --> 10:24.840
May I ask, Miss Li Zhen,

10:26.670 --> 10:29.390
how you got hold of this book?

10:31.720 --> 10:34.360
I found it by chance. I got it as a gift.
I bought it from a shop.

10:34.360 --> 10:36.820
Anyway, I didn't steal it
or rob anyone of it.

10:38.440 --> 10:40.240
You must be joking, Miss Li Zhen.

10:40.360 --> 10:43.720
I sincerely wish to buy this ancient book.

11:02.150 --> 11:04.560
Is there anything wrong with me?

11:06.000 --> 11:08.030
This book means a lot to me.

11:09.030 --> 11:11.550
It taught me the basic truths of ink,

11:12.080 --> 11:14.410
gave me the skills I need
to feed my family,

11:14.600 --> 11:16.800
and set me on a long path of exploration.

11:19.550 --> 11:22.150
This book serves
as a constant reminder for me,

11:22.840 --> 11:24.630
that if I am to create my own Way of Ink,

11:24.630 --> 11:26.160
then I must be concentrated

11:26.360 --> 11:28.220
and stay away from distractions.

11:29.670 --> 11:30.510
Therefore,

11:31.120 --> 11:33.320
this book is a priceless treasure to me.

11:33.670 --> 11:36.200
I will not sell it to anyone.

11:39.870 --> 11:40.600
Understood.

11:41.150 --> 11:43.360
I will not try to take away
what you cherish then.

11:43.360 --> 11:46.080
I suppose, Miss Li Zhen,
this book cannot find

11:46.790 --> 11:48.320
a better owner than you.

11:49.480 --> 11:52.320
That said, may I borrow it
and read it here

11:52.360 --> 11:53.480
for some time?

11:55.270 --> 11:56.440
Suit yourself.

11:58.720 --> 12:00.120
Just don't damage it.

12:01.730 --> 12:02.310
Sure.

12:48.390 --> 12:49.240
Miss Li Zhen,

12:49.960 --> 12:52.040
are you seeking these "organs"?

12:57.120 --> 12:59.320
So you've also done studies
on ink formulas,

12:59.320 --> 13:00.270
Master Qi?

13:01.720 --> 13:03.270
The human body contains 360 joints,

13:03.270 --> 13:04.790
9 orifices, 5 solid organs
and 6 hollow organs.

13:04.790 --> 13:08.250
I bet the organs mentioned here
refer to those inside animals.

13:08.670 --> 13:10.720
That was also my guess before.

13:11.080 --> 13:13.000
But that spot is smudged by ink.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.810
So I can't tell the exact words.

13:18.750 --> 13:19.390
Alright.

13:20.000 --> 13:22.660
I offer to find these items for you,
Miss Li Zhen.

13:22.960 --> 13:24.080
I will have them delivered

13:24.080 --> 13:25.750
to your residence within 3 days.

13:25.750 --> 13:27.480
This matter takes much effort.

13:27.600 --> 13:29.200
I'd rather not trouble you with it,
Master Qi.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.600
I'll handle it myself.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.970
Please give me some time, Miss Li Zhen.

13:33.030 --> 13:35.090
I promise I will show you my sincerity

13:35.510 --> 13:37.630
in cooperating with the Li family.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.840
Fine, whatever.

13:40.670 --> 13:42.960
Why mumble so much while reading the book?

13:42.960 --> 13:44.320
Give it back to me.

13:44.390 --> 13:45.190
I want it back.

13:46.480 --> 13:47.910
I haven't finished burning the wood.

13:47.910 --> 13:48.840
You're being a hindrance here.

13:48.840 --> 13:50.000
Save whatever you have to say for later.

13:50.000 --> 13:50.800
Please leave.

13:51.150 --> 13:51.840
Off you go.

13:52.630 --> 13:53.510
Leave the room.

13:53.510 --> 13:54.370
Hurry. Just go.

13:58.440 --> 13:59.970
Better keep the draft away.

14:03.790 --> 14:04.720
Is Zhen

14:05.200 --> 14:06.330
making any progress

14:06.750 --> 14:08.150
in the ink workshop?

14:08.960 --> 14:10.150
It's very difficult

14:11.200 --> 14:13.480
to recreate lacquer-soot ink.

14:13.790 --> 14:15.120
Not to mention Zhen—

14:15.360 --> 14:18.090
even the Sixth Master
hasn't made much progress.

14:18.840 --> 14:19.770
To add to that...

14:20.670 --> 14:21.600
Anything wrong?

14:23.390 --> 14:26.390
Workers from senior levels
like Manager Shao
to the bottom levels

14:26.390 --> 14:28.720
in the ink workshop are all against her.

14:29.150 --> 14:30.360
I guess these few days

14:30.440 --> 14:32.670
must be hard for Zhen.

14:34.840 --> 14:35.600
Mother,

14:36.960 --> 14:38.420
given that, I'm wondering

14:38.910 --> 14:39.790
if I should

14:40.280 --> 14:41.920
go give Master Sun

14:41.950 --> 14:43.030
a heads-up.

14:43.910 --> 14:45.120
If Zhen is really

14:45.510 --> 14:48.790
looking to launch a career
in the ink-making industry,

14:49.720 --> 14:51.580
whether she returns to the family

14:51.840 --> 14:53.640
or starts everything on her own,

14:54.120 --> 14:57.450
she'll have to earn everyone's support
in the ink workshop.

14:57.750 --> 15:00.670
This is a challenge she has to overcome.

15:02.200 --> 15:04.000
Years ago, your father,

15:04.550 --> 15:06.680
the Sixth Master, and the Eighth Uncle

15:06.720 --> 15:08.850
all went through the same rough patch.

15:23.200 --> 15:24.240
This is not right.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.240
How is it not right?

15:25.240 --> 15:28.640
The raw materials are not
in the right amount or proportions.

15:29.150 --> 15:30.270
How am I supposed to mix them up

15:30.270 --> 15:31.400
and make lampblack?

15:32.750 --> 15:33.510
This won't do.

15:33.510 --> 15:35.310
I must ask Manager Shao about it.

15:42.440 --> 15:43.320
Manager Shao,

15:43.800 --> 15:45.550
the raw materials
that Doggie brought to my smoke shed

15:45.550 --> 15:47.080
were handled by you, right?

15:47.270 --> 15:48.150
Yes, exactly.

15:48.390 --> 15:49.510
Is there a problem?

15:49.600 --> 15:50.600
Those raw materials

15:50.600 --> 15:51.930
are in different amount

15:52.120 --> 15:54.630
and proportions
from what's written on this list.

15:54.630 --> 15:57.360
How am I supposed to mix them up
to make lampblack?

15:59.320 --> 16:00.200
Miss Li Zhen,

16:01.000 --> 16:04.200
you've taken things from other smoke sheds
multiple times.

16:04.200 --> 16:05.910
I know you're working hard to make ink,

16:05.910 --> 16:07.750
so I've never held you accountable.

16:07.750 --> 16:09.510
Given that, this time
when I distributed materials,

16:09.510 --> 16:11.640
I deducted the corresponding amount.

16:13.440 --> 16:14.550
So you did deduct some of them.

16:14.550 --> 16:16.030
But without enough raw materials,

16:16.030 --> 16:17.360
how do I make lampblack?

16:17.440 --> 16:19.270
Has it ever occurred to you, Miss Li Zhen,

16:19.270 --> 16:22.320
that how others could make lampblack
with you taking their materials away?

16:22.320 --> 16:23.480
They might get anxious

16:23.480 --> 16:25.000
and ask for next month's materials.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.330
What would that lead to?

16:26.390 --> 16:26.840
I...

16:36.670 --> 16:37.550
Miss Li Zhen,

16:39.630 --> 16:42.320
you've been learning ink making
from Eighth Master Li.

16:42.320 --> 16:44.980
Do you know
who designed this registration book

16:45.200 --> 16:47.270
that you hate most?

16:49.030 --> 16:50.030
Who?

16:50.440 --> 16:52.300
Couldn't be my grandpa, could it?

17:18.109 --> 17:19.349
Decades ago,

17:19.720 --> 17:22.480
the old master of the Li family passed
way too early.

17:22.480 --> 17:25.480
The Sixth, Seventh, and Eighth Masters
were too young

17:25.920 --> 17:28.310
to control the workshop employees.

17:28.720 --> 17:30.580
Thus, Li Ink gradually declined.

17:31.880 --> 17:32.750
Later,

17:33.270 --> 17:35.350
the Seventh Master held the fort,

17:35.510 --> 17:39.040
while the Eighth Master
worked day and night to develop new ink,

17:39.270 --> 17:43.000
and the Sixth Master traveled everywhere
to collect materials and deliver goods.

17:43.000 --> 17:45.530
The Seventh Old Madam
managed issues at home.

17:45.640 --> 17:48.960
That way, Li Ink was finally stabilized,
and reached the prime

17:48.960 --> 17:53.090
where it competed several times
for the privilege to produce tribute ink.

17:53.680 --> 17:56.340
By then, I had just joined Li Ink
as an apprentice

17:57.030 --> 17:59.400
who ran errands a lot like Doggie.

18:00.960 --> 18:02.820
The Eighth Master took me with him

18:02.830 --> 18:06.350
and set up rules for Li Ink,
registering every detail

18:06.480 --> 18:09.070
in this book, however trivial that was.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.440
Miss Li Zhen,

18:11.790 --> 18:14.640
obeying rules is the basis
of accompliments.

18:17.160 --> 18:18.590
People respectfully
refer to the Eighth Master

18:18.590 --> 18:21.400
as head of the Five Ink-making
Grandmasters of the dynasty.

18:21.400 --> 18:24.460
Do you think it's just
because of his exquisite skills?

18:27.240 --> 18:29.370
I don't have much talent in making ink.

18:29.790 --> 18:31.480
After spending my entire life
learning from him,

18:31.480 --> 18:33.550
the only thing I've picked up
is "caution."

18:33.550 --> 18:36.410
And that already makes me feel
I've benefited a lot.

18:38.640 --> 18:40.700
There is so much more you need to learn

18:40.960 --> 18:42.310
from your grandfather.

18:50.750 --> 18:52.410
Back then, was my grandfather

18:53.270 --> 18:54.790
as indifferent

18:55.270 --> 18:56.350
as you are now?

19:21.750 --> 19:24.110
The Eighth Master kept this log himself.

19:25.510 --> 19:26.750
Take a look.

19:27.930 --> 19:30.060
[Manifest of Materials
for the Ink Workshop]

19:29.580 --> 19:31.380
It was made in the year I was born.

19:44.400 --> 19:46.640
I didn't know Grandpa would often record

19:46.640 --> 19:49.000
what the Sixth Grandfather did.

19:58.170 --> 20:00.580
[Li Jingfu]

20:01.000 --> 20:03.730
My father's doing
was actually recorded as well.

20:24.310 --> 20:25.350
Manager Shao,

20:26.030 --> 20:28.270
I was wrong before.

20:29.350 --> 20:30.750
I accept the punishment.

20:30.990 --> 20:32.250
I dare not have you bow.

20:34.830 --> 20:37.110
I am merely strictly following

20:37.110 --> 20:38.830
the rules of Li Ink.

20:39.680 --> 20:41.140
To be honest, Miss Li Zhen,

20:41.590 --> 20:42.750
when you first arrived,

20:42.750 --> 20:44.480
I did have some doubts.

20:45.480 --> 20:47.000
But after a few days' observation,

20:47.000 --> 20:48.790
I can tell that you've been humble

20:48.790 --> 20:51.440
and working hard day and night
with one single focus

20:51.440 --> 20:53.680
on recreating
the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.880
I've really found you admirable.

20:57.830 --> 20:58.830
Manager Shao, please don't.

20:58.830 --> 20:59.750
I should be the one
paying respects to you.

20:59.750 --> 21:01.270
This has never happened before.

21:01.270 --> 21:02.730
We demand an explanation!

21:03.510 --> 21:04.440
What's going on?

21:04.790 --> 21:05.640
Manager Shao.

21:06.030 --> 21:07.200
You're also here, Miss Li Zhen.

21:07.200 --> 21:08.330
That's even better.

21:09.200 --> 21:10.030
Manager Shao,

21:10.960 --> 21:13.820
this is the lampblack
made by Master Wei yesterday.

21:13.880 --> 21:14.590
Look.

21:15.640 --> 21:16.840
Such a mess, isn't it?

21:19.750 --> 21:21.440
It's all thanks to Miss Li Zhen.

21:21.440 --> 21:24.160
She sneaked into the ink workshop
at midnight and let the wind in.

21:24.160 --> 21:25.070
The lampblack

21:25.310 --> 21:26.570
is completely ruined.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.030
Manager Shao,

21:30.480 --> 21:32.150
I did do wrong by rashly entering

21:32.150 --> 21:33.750
the ink workshop last night,

21:34.030 --> 21:36.440
which violated the rules
for using smoke sheds.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.920
But when I arrived

21:38.270 --> 21:41.070
at that very smoke shed yesterday,

21:41.440 --> 21:43.310
there was no one
or finished lampblack at all.

21:43.310 --> 21:44.030
Young lady,

21:44.790 --> 21:47.190
stop talking nonsense and shifting blame.

21:47.200 --> 21:49.310
I spent all of yesterday
making lampblack in that smoke shed.

21:49.310 --> 21:51.920
Indeed, I saw it with my own eyes.

21:52.830 --> 21:53.960
Did you also see it as well?

21:53.960 --> 21:56.240
-Yes!
-That's right!

21:59.880 --> 22:00.880
Manager Shao,

22:01.350 --> 22:03.030
if my memory serves me right,

22:03.240 --> 22:05.070
every action in the ink workshop,

22:05.070 --> 22:07.480
including using smoke sheds,
and collecting lamp oil,

22:07.480 --> 22:09.480
raw materials, and other supplies,

22:09.480 --> 22:10.940
must be registered by you.

22:10.960 --> 22:11.920
Am I right?

22:12.070 --> 22:13.270
That's the standard procedure.

22:13.270 --> 22:15.510
Yesterday, I personally asked Shao
for permission

22:15.510 --> 22:16.720
to use that smoke shed.

22:16.720 --> 22:18.980
Check out the log if you don't believe me.

22:38.920 --> 22:41.720
You did use that smoke shed yesterday.

22:42.790 --> 22:43.920
But there isn't a record

22:43.920 --> 22:45.720
of you collecting raw materials
for making lampblack.

22:45.720 --> 22:47.110
Then where did you source

22:47.110 --> 22:49.240
the materials for making that lampblack?

22:49.240 --> 22:50.110
I... I...

22:51.550 --> 22:54.640
Could it be that you, Mr. Wei,
violated the rules first by taking

22:54.640 --> 22:56.500
materials without registering?

22:56.790 --> 22:57.720
Manager Shao,

22:58.070 --> 22:59.920
I remember you once told me

23:00.510 --> 23:01.960
that in the ink workshop,

23:02.160 --> 23:05.110
taking materials without registering
is equal to stealing.

23:05.110 --> 23:05.790
No, no.

23:06.030 --> 23:07.590
P-Perhaps I just used

23:07.640 --> 23:09.640
t-the leftover materials
from a few days ago.

23:09.640 --> 23:11.720
I-I can't remember clearly.

23:27.750 --> 23:30.810
It was 7 days ago
when you last collected raw materials.

23:31.720 --> 23:34.270
But you already delivered products
the day before yesterday.

23:34.270 --> 23:36.000
I also checked the smoke sheds.

23:36.310 --> 23:37.710
There were no leftovers.

23:46.030 --> 23:47.750
I have such a bad memory.

23:48.480 --> 23:51.440
This lampblack was a failed product
from a few days ago.

23:51.440 --> 23:52.830
Due to my packed schedule,

23:52.830 --> 23:54.550
I forgot to have it registered.

23:54.550 --> 23:56.610
It has nothing to do with Miss Li Zhen.

23:59.680 --> 24:01.440
Since it's a misunderstanding,

24:01.440 --> 24:02.350
Mr. Wei,

24:03.270 --> 24:05.310
please apologize to Miss Li Zhen.

24:11.310 --> 24:13.790
The ink workshop is busy and crowded.

24:14.240 --> 24:15.510
So I got confused.

24:15.920 --> 24:17.450
My apologies, Miss Li Zhen.

24:19.510 --> 24:20.270
No worries.

24:21.200 --> 24:22.200
Everyone, leave.

24:22.880 --> 24:23.750
Go to work.

24:35.310 --> 24:36.570
Thanks, Manager Shao.

24:40.400 --> 24:41.030
Grandpa,

24:41.440 --> 24:42.580
was Dad punished with a fine

24:42.580 --> 24:44.780
back when he worked in the ink workshop?

24:47.510 --> 24:48.920
More than just a fine.

24:49.480 --> 24:50.830
There are strict rules
in the ink workshop.

24:50.830 --> 24:52.230
Your grandpa always said

24:52.270 --> 24:53.960
it was no easy job for the workers
to support their families.

24:53.960 --> 24:55.310
So he couldn't bear
to impose a large fine.

24:55.310 --> 24:56.240
Therefore, at the end,

24:56.240 --> 24:58.900
all the responsibility
was piled onto your dad.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.280
You weren't even born back then.

25:01.510 --> 25:03.240
Zhengliang might remember it.

25:03.960 --> 25:06.440
There was a time when your grandpa
withheld a whole month's salary

25:06.440 --> 25:08.030
from your dad as punishment.

25:08.030 --> 25:08.950
Your dad hadn't a dime

25:08.950 --> 25:10.310
or the guts to tell me the truth.

25:10.310 --> 25:11.310
Guess what he did?

25:12.720 --> 25:14.720
Your dad actually secretly went through

25:14.720 --> 25:16.310
my dowry in the middle of the night.

25:16.310 --> 25:17.920
I caught him red-handed!

25:19.480 --> 25:21.070
One night, you chased Dad around,
beat him,

25:21.070 --> 25:22.060
and even got out of the house.

25:22.060 --> 25:23.520
That was the night, right?

25:23.720 --> 25:25.640
Mother, is it true?

25:25.960 --> 25:27.090
Of course it's true.

25:27.550 --> 25:29.160
He had the gall to steal my dowry.

25:29.160 --> 25:30.030
I was furious!

25:30.750 --> 25:31.590
Therefore,

25:31.790 --> 25:33.110
Zhen, Qiu'e,

25:33.680 --> 25:34.720
keep this in mind:

25:35.200 --> 25:38.000
make sure you hide your dowries well
in the future.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.480
Men,

25:40.510 --> 25:41.440
all the men,

25:42.000 --> 25:43.240
are like turnips.

25:46.590 --> 25:48.520
Father, I'm not talking about you.

25:51.590 --> 25:52.200
Mother.

25:52.200 --> 25:52.900
Thank you, Mother.

25:52.900 --> 25:54.360
Is my brother a turnip too?

25:55.960 --> 25:56.960
Your brother?

25:57.030 --> 25:58.200
He's as dumb as a turnip!

25:58.200 --> 25:59.070
Mother.

25:59.240 --> 26:00.790
She's saying you're as dumb as a turnip!

26:00.790 --> 26:02.550
Come on, eat more turnips.

26:02.880 --> 26:03.400
I want some too.

26:03.400 --> 26:04.070
Dig in!

26:05.960 --> 26:07.760
Zhengliang, have more turnips.

26:08.240 --> 26:09.300
Keep quiet please.

26:10.200 --> 26:10.920
Zhen.

26:13.400 --> 26:14.600
Follow Shao An's lead

26:14.880 --> 26:15.940
and learn from him.

26:16.650 --> 26:17.650
I might not be able

26:18.510 --> 26:20.110
to teach you what he can.

26:22.110 --> 26:23.240
I know.

26:25.110 --> 26:27.480
How is the lampblack coming along?

26:29.550 --> 26:30.950
Once animal fat is added,

26:31.070 --> 26:32.920
there will be oil slicks
that can't be washed away.

26:32.920 --> 26:34.310
I've tried several methods,

26:34.310 --> 26:36.240
but the results are not very ideal.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.830
That said, don't worry, Grandpa.

26:37.830 --> 26:39.920
I already have a clue about this matter.

26:39.920 --> 26:41.030
If worst comes to worst,

26:41.030 --> 26:43.510
I'll try out the six bowels of those livestock one by one.

26:43.510 --> 26:46.110
I'll eventually find
a suitable combination.

26:46.310 --> 26:47.070
That's good.

26:47.350 --> 26:48.280
Hurry and eat up.

26:52.920 --> 26:54.850
I don't know what kind of livestock

26:54.960 --> 26:56.910
or what kind of internal organ it uses.

26:56.910 --> 26:57.800
Trying out the combinations

26:57.800 --> 26:59.530
will take nearly 100 attempts.

26:59.960 --> 27:01.240
When will this end?

27:01.640 --> 27:02.840
Miss Li Zhen, it seems

27:02.880 --> 27:04.680
that you still don't believe me.

27:08.240 --> 27:10.720
I never pin my hopes on other people.

27:18.310 --> 27:19.720
The purest internal organ

27:19.720 --> 27:20.850
is the gallbladder.

27:27.590 --> 27:28.440
Over the past few days,

27:28.440 --> 27:30.370
I have been rushing about day and night,

27:30.370 --> 27:31.920
visiting numerous great scholars.

27:31.920 --> 27:34.550
Only then did I confirm that what was
recorded in the ancient text

27:34.550 --> 27:36.210
is the purest internal organ.

27:42.640 --> 27:45.350
I apologize for my attitude before.

27:45.480 --> 27:47.350
Please don't take offense, Master Qi.

27:47.350 --> 27:48.110
Not at all.

27:48.480 --> 27:50.480
However, although I have confirmed

27:50.480 --> 27:52.960
that the ancient text
refers to the purest internal organ,

27:52.960 --> 27:55.790
as for exactly which animal's bile it is,

27:56.240 --> 27:56.960
I...

27:56.960 --> 27:58.510
Master Qi, you have already
helped me a lot.

27:58.510 --> 28:00.720
I can handle the rest myself.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.000
Please.

28:07.030 --> 28:08.030
Thank you so much.

28:08.110 --> 28:09.040
You're welcome.

28:17.680 --> 28:19.640
Is there anything else, Master Qi?

28:21.750 --> 28:23.070
If there is nothing else,

28:23.070 --> 28:24.470
please see yourself out.

28:27.270 --> 28:28.000
Please.

28:35.480 --> 28:36.070
Alright.

30:22.440 --> 30:23.240
It's done?

31:19.440 --> 31:20.440
Eighth Master Li.

31:22.550 --> 31:23.550
Eighth Master Li.

31:24.310 --> 31:25.310
Eighth Master Li!

31:25.750 --> 31:26.750
Eighth Master Li!

31:27.350 --> 31:28.350
Eighth Master Li.

31:33.440 --> 31:34.570
Eighth Master Li...

31:36.390 --> 31:38.370
Zhen recreated the long-lost

31:38.830 --> 31:40.160
supreme-grade ancient

31:40.310 --> 31:41.440
lacquer lampblack.

32:32.030 --> 32:32.640
Father.

32:33.310 --> 32:34.310
It's almost done.

32:34.960 --> 32:35.960
It's almost done.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.000
Jingdong.

33:23.310 --> 33:24.200
Jingdong.

33:25.480 --> 33:26.590
Stop working on it.

33:28.880 --> 33:31.110
Zhen has succeeded.

33:34.270 --> 33:36.240
She successfully recreated

33:37.440 --> 33:39.160
the supreme-grade lampblack

33:39.880 --> 33:41.740
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

34:05.490 --> 34:06.750
Seventh Grandmother,

34:07.200 --> 34:08.030
I

34:10.360 --> 34:11.120
made it.

34:46.370 --> 34:47.770
Zhen.

34:48.920 --> 34:52.070
Now that this lacquer lampblack is
a great success,

34:53.330 --> 34:54.199
Li Ink

34:56.440 --> 34:57.930
can be saved.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.230
Zhen.

35:07.030 --> 35:08.070
It was you

35:09.320 --> 35:10.800
who saved Li Ink.

35:18.110 --> 35:19.800
I'd like to thank you

35:21.400 --> 35:22.590
on behalf of Li Ink.

35:22.630 --> 35:23.360
Seventh Grandmother.

35:23.360 --> 35:23.630
Mother.

35:23.630 --> 35:24.480
Please get up.

35:24.510 --> 35:25.640
I can't accept this.

35:26.840 --> 35:28.360
You don't need to thank me.

35:29.030 --> 35:30.840
It's what I should do.

35:42.800 --> 35:45.760
The lampblack's ingredient combination
for the ancient lacquer-soot ink

35:45.760 --> 35:47.280
has been worked out.

35:48.110 --> 35:51.320
To completely restore
the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

35:52.000 --> 35:54.130
there are still countless processes.

35:55.230 --> 35:56.760
Today, I

35:57.880 --> 35:59.630
completely entrust

36:00.320 --> 36:02.000
this important matter

36:02.670 --> 36:04.400
to you.

36:11.190 --> 36:12.510
Please rest assured.

36:12.840 --> 36:13.630
I

36:14.070 --> 36:15.630
will not let you down.

36:54.400 --> 36:56.960
Hundreds of thousands of hammerings
with a weak gelatin binder.

36:56.960 --> 36:58.480
One strike less

36:58.920 --> 37:01.710
would disgrace the Li family’s name.

37:03.110 --> 37:06.630
Mother, we must have faith in Zhen.

37:22.860 --> 37:27.880
[Li Ink]

37:31.400 --> 37:32.230
Zhen is here!

37:32.360 --> 37:33.090
Zhen is here!

37:33.150 --> 37:34.030
Put on clothes!

37:36.280 --> 37:38.110
I-I'm fine.

37:38.180 --> 37:39.130
You can continue.

37:39.130 --> 37:40.390
No need to get dressed.

37:40.480 --> 37:41.710
I'm not looking!

37:41.710 --> 37:43.570
I'm not looking! I'm not looking!

37:53.070 --> 37:53.870
What's wrong?

37:54.800 --> 37:55.440
Nothing.

38:07.760 --> 38:08.490
Miss Li Zhen.

38:09.070 --> 38:09.880
Manager Shao.

38:16.630 --> 38:17.470
Look at her.

39:29.320 --> 39:30.110
Old Madam.

39:34.710 --> 39:35.510
Aunt Rujun.

39:36.050 --> 39:39.180
This is the ancient lacquer-soot ink
recreated by Zhen.

39:45.230 --> 39:47.030
Spring, summer, autumn, and winter?

39:47.030 --> 39:50.090
Why did you use the four seasons
as the carving pattern?

39:50.230 --> 39:51.840
This was Zhen's proposal.

39:52.110 --> 39:54.000
She said the Four Seasons painting

39:54.000 --> 39:55.960
reflects the difficulty of ink-making

39:55.960 --> 39:57.960
and her wish that fine ink
may stay with people for a long time—

39:57.960 --> 40:00.590
its ink never fading through
the four seasons of the year.

40:00.590 --> 40:01.150
Right.

40:01.280 --> 40:02.510
The gold tracing on it

40:02.630 --> 40:04.760
was personally drawn by Manager Shao.

40:05.670 --> 40:07.000
I'm ashamed.

40:07.070 --> 40:08.710
I've followed Eighth Master Li
for half my life.

40:08.710 --> 40:09.880
I didn't master ink-making,

40:09.880 --> 40:11.400
only picked up the basics.

40:19.760 --> 40:21.020
Seventh Grandmother.

40:21.400 --> 40:22.340
How well

40:22.960 --> 40:24.360
have I restored this ink?

40:27.290 --> 40:28.420
Excellent.

40:31.280 --> 40:32.320
Zhen.

40:33.400 --> 40:36.280
A single ink stick requires hundreds
of soot firing,

40:36.280 --> 40:38.070
over ten thousand hammerings
to bind the glue,

40:38.070 --> 40:41.880
and still must be carved,
molded, and air-dried.

40:42.110 --> 40:44.230
Making ink is no easy task.

40:44.630 --> 40:45.550
Here,

40:46.400 --> 40:49.710
lies the hard work
of all the ink-maker in the ink workshop.

40:56.630 --> 40:57.670
I understand.

41:06.590 --> 41:07.550
Grandpa!

41:23.760 --> 41:24.480
Grandpa.

41:27.550 --> 41:28.550
I recreated

41:30.490 --> 41:31.750
the lacquer-soot ink.

42:17.920 --> 42:19.850
When making the lacquer-soot ink,

42:21.030 --> 42:22.550
if your mind drifts,

42:24.150 --> 42:26.610
the ink loses its depth
and becomes shallow.

42:33.670 --> 42:34.670
This ink

42:35.860 --> 42:38.200
[Beauty in All Four Seasons]

42:36.280 --> 42:37.800
is firm as jade.

42:43.150 --> 42:44.550
Li Ink prizes a spirit

42:45.800 --> 42:47.260
of unyielding integrity.

42:59.030 --> 43:00.280
True backbone.
